flowchart TB
accTitle: Field protection and cache reuse are separate decisions
accDescr: Payment POST fields stay encrypted through intermediate components. Public versioned assets can use a longer cache lifetime. Payment responses remain uncached.
C[CloudFront request]:::inputData --> T{Request path?}:::decision
T -->|Payment POST| E[HTTPS and selected<br/>field encryption]:::process
E --> I[Intermediate components<br/>Encrypted field values]:::process
I --> D[Payment component<br/>Private key decrypts]:::output
T -->|Public asset GET| A[Versioned asset cache<br/>Appropriate longer TTL]:::storage
A --> H[Reuse cached asset<br/>on a valid hit]:::output
